<title>UK: SNOOKER-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SNOOKER-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>SHEFFIELD, England 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of quarter-final matches (best of 25 frames) in the world professional snooker championship on Wednesday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>1-Stephen Hendry (Scotland) beat 9-Darren Morgan (Wales) 13-10</p>
<p>Frame scores (Hendry first):9-76 0-98 97-28 67-39 69-8 10-75 9-77 0-67 77-15 0-102 76-9 71-1 71-8 99-0 0-105 80-53 24-58 7-69 70-28 96-13 57-74 86-1 86-37  </p>
<p>14-Alain Robidoux (Canada) beat Lee Walker (Wales) 13-8</p>
<p>Frame scores: (Robidoux first) 39-73 86-17 2-71 6-81 71-33</p>
<p>75-44 22-71 69-25 70-7 81-31 54-43 9-87 13-64 31-66 105-38 65-18</p>
<p>37-69 113-14 65-26 84-25 80-0.</p>
<p>7-Ken Doherty (Ireland) beat 2-John Higgins (Scotland) 13-9.</p>
<p>Frame scores (Doherty first): 47-76 61-70 42-87 86-43 74-21</p>
<p>66-59 20-73 54-7 91-0, 30-65 41-55 72-4 64-19 68-23 52-24 46-71</p>
<p>0-95 66-16 90-24 23-76 78-41 116-1.</p>
